ons, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. To avoid charging for the flight twice, I booked the hotel on its own instead of retrying the combined booking. As a result, the flight and hotel are two separate reservations instead of one trip booking.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QZJybQoUKreCFS53UJNguS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HTetdHWnEKjCnCyScu7V6t", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011tNXLP2kipSG21DVnhii6Z", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The booking request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01S39tHxHq3k5C5Ju6Dppagb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight went through but the hotel didn't. I'll book only the hotel so the flight doesn't get charged twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012Eeb915GRtfVmsi62DNboQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin"